  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="38">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 38</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þa man getwæmde þæt ær wæs gemæne Criste ⁊ cynincge on worldlicre steore, ⁊ a hit wearð þe wirse for Gode ⁊ for worlde; cume nu to bote, gif hit God wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And then the [dues from] civil penalties which had previously been shared between Christ and the king were separated, and things have continually gone from bad to worse both in religious and in secular affairs. God grant that there may now be improvement.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
